      "content": "LONDON ROAD 1. 5252                                                   (South Side)                                                   No 427 TL 0405 4/184 II                       GV 2. Early C19.  Red brick, machine tiled roof.  2 storeys.  2 sash windows with glazing bars in reveals under cutter flat arches.  Lower 2 window wing on right.  Side elevation doorway and porch with slim pilasters.  Included for group value. Nos 427 to 437 (odd) form a group. Listing NGR: TL0477905957"
    }
